# Responsibilities: Exclude private/local state and generated artifacts from the submission repo.
# Implementation: Generic rules apply at every depth; module-specific rules use SystemCode paths.
# Related Modules: SystemCode/.gitattributes controls source-archive and LFS behavior.
# Declaration Index: None.
# Variable Index: SystemCode/backend, SystemCode/DigitalHuman and SystemCode/rag patterns cover
# application databases, generated Unreal assets, and local corpus/model artifacts respectively;
# .deploy excludes private standalone configuration, database backups and deployment locks.
.deploy/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
.runtime/
.idea/
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.next/
*.log
tmp/
output/
Wang_Shunyao_CV.pdf

# Backend development database and runtime artifacts
SystemCode/backend/*.sqlite3
SystemCode/backend/*.sqlite3-*
SystemCode/backend/test-results/
SystemCode/backend/.capacity/

# Unreal generated files; Content assets and project source remain versioned.
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/Binaries/
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/Plugins/**/Binaries/
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/Plugins/**/Intermediate/
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/Intermediate/
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/Saved/
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/DerivedDataCache/
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/BuildOutput/
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/.vs/
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/*.sln
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/*.suo
SystemCode/DigitalHuman/Tools/PixelStreamingInfrastructure/

# Local server credentials supplied by the user; never include in source archives.
server_info.txt

# RAG module: generated pipeline data, caches and local model weights stay out of Git.
# (SystemCode/rag/data/sources.yaml, data/eval/ and small markdown reports are versioned.)
SystemCode/rag/data/raw/
SystemCode/rag/data/clean/
SystemCode/rag/data/chunks/
SystemCode/rag/data/embeddings/
SystemCode/rag/data/reports/*.json
SystemCode/rag/data/reports/dropped/
SystemCode/rag/data/models/
